title: "Suede Creator Skills"
abstract: >-
  A public, open-source (MIT) pack of 70 installable Agent Skills for Claude Code
  and OpenAI Codex, plus an optional Model Context Protocol (MCP) server. Covers
  outcome-bound orchestration through Suede Full Send, design, anti-slop
  copywriting, SEO/AEO/AI EO audits, reference-site restyling (Suedify), website
  visibility and CTA grading, A-F code grading, agent QA, launch packaging,
  Instagram growth, artist-campaign tools, and creator rights utilities.
